 |OriginalAirDate={{Start date|2012|12|10}}
 |Viewers=2.41<ref>{{cite web|last=Bibel|first=Sara|title=Monday Cable Ratings: Monday Night Football Wins Night, 'Catfish', 'Teen Mom 2', 'WWE Raw', 'Pawn Stars' & More|url=http://tvbythenumbers.zap2it.com/2012/12/11/monday-cable-ratings-monday-night-football-wins-night-catfish-teen-mom-2-wwe-raw-pawn-stars-more/161135/|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20121214090118/http://tvbythenumbers.zap2it.com/2012/12/11/monday-cable-ratings-monday-night-football-wins-night-catfish-teen-mom-2-wwe-raw-pawn-stars-more/161135/|url-status=dead|archive-date=December 14, 2012|publisher=TV by the Numbers|access-date=December 11, 2012}}</ref>
 |ShortSummary=Jarrod is a divorced father from Georgia who fell for a blonde girl on Facebook, "Abby". Jarrod told Nev that he had even proposed to Abby and she said yes. She also promised to move in with him but never did.<ref>{{cite web |title=Catfish: The TV Show : Jarrod & Abby |url=http://tvlistings.zap2it.com/tv/catfish-the-tv-show-jarrod-and-abby/EP016169680005 |access-date=November 24, 2012 |archive-date=December 6, 2012 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20121206052526/http://tvlistings.zap2it.com/tv/catfish-the-tv-show-jarrod-and-abby/EP016169680005 |url-status=dead }}</ref> When Nev finally introduces them after a year and a half of talking, "Abby" turns out to be an obese girl named Melissa whose low self-esteeem led her to create the fake profile. In the epilogue, Jarrod has put his romantic pursuits on hold and is focusing on music since filming ended. He and Melissa continued to talk to each other every day. Melissa had deactivated her Abby profile and also lost 15 pounds. She is glad Jarrod has kept her in his life and hopes that love could still blossom between them.
 |LineColor = B4EEB4
}}
