 |Title= Kya & Alyx
 |OriginalAirDate={{Start date|2012|12|17}}
 |Viewers=2.07<ref>{{cite web|last=Kondolojy|first=Amanda|title=Monday Cable Ratings: Monday Night Football Wins Night, + 'Monday Night RAW', 'Pawn Stars', 'Teen Mom II', 'Catfish' & More|url=http://tvbythenumbers.zap2it.com/2012/12/18/monday-cable-ratings-monday-night-football-wins-night-monday-night-raw-pawn-stars-teen-mom-ii-catfish-more/162188/|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20121222012648/http://tvbythenumbers.zap2it.com/2012/12/18/monday-cable-ratings-monday-night-football-wins-night-monday-night-raw-pawn-stars-teen-mom-ii-catfish-more/162188/|url-status=dead|archive-date=December 22, 2012|publisher=TV by the Numbers|access-date=December 18, 2012}}</ref>
 |ShortSummary=When Kya first met Alyx online, she used a fake name and fake pictures. She later told him the truth and Alyx forgave her. Nev helps Kya finally meet Alyx, who she says she has fallen in love with but has never actually met. When they meet, Alyx turns out to be a [[transgender]] man. They decide to stay a couple after Kya learns the truth. In the epilogue, Alyx is continuing hormone replacement therapy and saving up for gender-reassignment surgery.<ref>{{cite web|title=S01E06 - Kya & Alyx|url=http://tvlistings.zap2it.com/tv/catfish-the-tv-show-kya-and-alyx/EP016169680006?aid=zap2it|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20121221203814/http://tvlistings.zap2it.com/tv/catfish-the-tv-show-kya-and-alyx/EP016169680006?aid=zap2it|url-status=dead|archive-date=December 21, 2012|publisher=Zap2It|access-date=December 9, 2012}}</ref>
